<section id="how-it-works" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-forest text-cream">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 md:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12"><p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.16em] uppercase lg:col-span-3">02 / The session</p><h2 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.055em] md:text-6xl lg:col-span-9">We do not redesign the entire business in one meeting.</h2></div><ol class="mt-20 grid border-t border-white/25 md:grid-cols-3"><li class="border-b border-white/25 py-8 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:pr-8"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-white">01</p><h3 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Map the core flow</h3><p class="mt-4 max-w-xs leading-relaxed text-white/70">Start with how value moves through the business: demand, decisions, delivery, and the work around it.</p></li><li class="border-b border-white/25 py-8 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-8"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-white">02</p><h3 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Surface the drag</h3><p class="mt-4 max-w-xs leading-relaxed text-white/70">Identify the recurring problems, delays, rework, missed opportunities, and bottlenecks that are doing the most damage.</p></li><li class="py-8 md:pl-8"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-white">03</p><h3 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Rank what matters</h3><p class="mt-4 max-w-xs leading-relaxed text-white/70">Compare those constraints with reasonable estimates, then choose the smallest practical intervention worth making first.</p></li></ol></div>
